        "en": [
          "A timeless hour of storytelling. The Arbre à Palabres booksellers will read you their favourites for young readers, based on different themes: family stories, playing with words, cabaret, staying warm, nothing but love!\n\nSaturdays March 28, April 4, May 9 and June 6, 2026\n16h"
        ],
        "it": [
